message: 'To cite package "epiworldRShiny" in publications use:'
type: software
license: MIT
title: 'epiworldRShiny: A ''shiny'' Wrapper of the R Package ''epiworldR'''
version: 0.2.6
doi: 10.32614/CRAN.package.epiworldRShiny
abstract: R 'shiny' web apps for epidemiological Agent-Based Models. It provides a
  user-friendly interface to the Agent-Based Modeling (ABM) R package 'epiworldR'
  (Meyer et al., 2023) <DOI:10.21105/joss.05781>. Some of the main features of the
  package include the Susceptible-Infected-Susceptible (SIS), Susceptible-Infected-Recovered
  (SIR), and Susceptible-Exposed-Infected-Recovered (SEIR) models. 'epiworldRShiny'
  provides a web-based user interface for running various epidemiological ABMs, simulating
  interventions, and visualizing results interactively.
